  "description": {
    "html": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Make a lasting impression with this Purple Rayon Silk Sherwani, crafted from premium rayon silk fabric with elegant highlight embroidery. Designed with a sophisticated Bandhgala neckline, full sleeves, and a button closure, this sherwani offers a regal and refined look. Paired with cream Aligarhi pants and a matching dupatta, it is an ideal choice for weddings, receptions, engagements, and grand festive celebrations.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Key Features</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Premium Purple Rayon Silk Fabric</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Elegant Highlight Embroidery</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Classic Bandhgala Neckline</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Full Sleeves with Button Closure</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Above-Length Sherwani</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Cream Aligarhi Pants &amp; Matching Dupatta Included</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Ideal for Weddings, Receptions, Engagements &amp; Festive Occasions</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Styling Tips</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Pair with black juttis for a classic royal look.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Style with black leather shoes for evening receptions and formal celebrations.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Complete the ensemble with maroon slip-on shoes for a refined festive appearance.</div>",
    "text": "Make a lasting impression with this Purple Rayon Silk Sherwani, crafted from premium rayon silk fabric with elegant highlight embroidery. Designed with a sophisticated Bandhgala neckline, full sleeves, and a button closure, this sherwani offers a regal and refined look. Paired with cream Aligarhi pants and a matching dupatta, it is an ideal choice for weddings, receptions, engagements, and grand festive celebrations.\nKey Features\nPremium Purple Rayon Silk Fabric\nElegant Highlight Embroidery\nClassic Bandhgala Neckline\nFull Sleeves with Button Closure\nAbove-Length Sherwani\nCream Aligarhi Pants & Matching Dupatta Included\nIdeal for Weddings, Receptions, Engagements & Festive Occasions\nStyling Tips\nPair with black juttis for a classic royal look.\nStyle with black leather shoes for evening receptions and formal celebrations.\nComplete the ensemble with maroon slip-on shoes for a refined festive appearance.",
    "parsed": {
      "intro": {
        "text": [
          "Make a lasting impression with this Purple Rayon Silk Sherwani, crafted from premium rayon silk fabric with elegant highlight embroidery. Designed with a sophisticated Bandhgala neckline, full sleeves, and a button closure, this sherwani offers a regal and refined look. Paired with cream Aligarhi pants and a matching dupatta, it is an ideal choice for weddings, receptions, engagements, and grand festive celebrations.",
          "Cream Aligarhi Pants & Matching Dupatta Included",
          "Ideal for Weddings, Receptions, Engagements & Festive Occasions",
          "Pair with black juttis for a classic royal look.",
          "Style with black leather shoes for evening receptions and formal celebrations.",
          "Complete the ensemble with maroon slip-on shoes for a refined festive appearance."
        ]
      },
